  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "3101 Skyway (PODS)", "status": "Prospect", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 2003.0, "units": 1.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": 0.07406772727272727, "sqft": 31120.0, "acres": 1.6, "price": 2200000.0, "psf": 70.69408740359897, "notes": "(Mark Wainwright, Pine Street) Occupied by PODS (national tenant); low lease rate ($5-6 PSF) w/annual steps; reimb. taxes and insur. Listed price and NOI recently decreased. Sprinklered and climate-controlled; 31'-34' ceiling height. WM & Lance to visit property to inspect condition. Ask for a 5-year extension of the lease, with bumps extending to 2031. This building was the prototype for PODS and build to their specifications. Interest from different users given unique height of the building. Seller is a PODS franchisee. Palm Bay PODS location is a corporate location. Building does not meet building protype. Corporate PODS is considering relocation. (Possible tenant for Port Canaveral Logistics building?) Selling property b/c Seller feels it's a good time to sell. Seeking to cash out on corporate facilities and keep the ones they still own as a franchisee. Warehouse is climate controlled and on city sewer.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-30"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "3950 Dow Road (Winchester Building)", "status": "Prospect", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1984.0, "units": 10.0, "occupancy": "TBC", "capRate": 0.08, "sqft": 40488.0, "acres": 4.19, "price": 3600000.0, "psf": 88.91523414344991, "notes": "(LBR) Winchester Building; off-market transaction, but VERY OLD BUILDING\n•\tBelieves we can acquire at an 8 CAP. There was no mention of rents, NOI or price.\n•\tBuilding is located at the intersection of Dow Road and North Street in Melbourne strike zone.\n•\tSellers are owner/users of space and want to sell to lock in profit on the building.\n•\tThey are indifferent about being renters or owners. \n•\tThe building is a flex/office/warehouse with 40,488 square feet and 3,300 SFT of open porch.\n•\tThe deed records indicate the building was originally partitioned as 10 units. Need to confirm.\n•\tIt is owned and occupied by high tech engineering employees; LT lease is in place\n•\tHistory – Rob was a consultant on the refinance and ownership change of the building is 2018. From the tax records, it appears the building was purchased in 2018 from the owner/lessor for $3.6M. The owner/lessor purchased the building in 2008 for $3.4M.\n•\tCeiling height is 13’ according to tax records", "dateAdded": null},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Port Canaveral Logistics Center \n(7700 US Highway 1)", "status": "Price Discussions", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Titusville, FL", "yearBuilt": 2016.0, "units": "3+", "occupancy": 0.45, "capRate": 0.035395175675675676, "sqft": 247069.0, "acres": 12.8, "price": 18500000.0, "psf": 74.87786812590815, "notes": "(LBR) $18.5MM expected to get the deal done; $16.5MM and $17MM offers turned-down. Marketed for $21.95 million, however it's been on the market for several years now. $15MM existing debt on facility; property is currently at break-even. 45% occupied w/mix of aerospace and distribution tenants (RUAG and Ralph's Transfer); 137,160 SF vacant. CONFIRM PRICING FOR ADJACENT LAND AS WELL (10 ACRES); owned by FL East Coast Railroad.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "**Chaffee Drive in Titusville**", "status": "Targeting", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Titusville, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": 10.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "1960's to 1990's infrastructure bounded by Challenger Memorial Parkway, Grissom Parkway, Columbia Boulevard and Shepard Drive. Rob confirming owner info; also gather data from county appraiser site. Potentially a very good value play. Multi-tenant industrial appears to be in good shape and may be good candidates (3 buidings / 2 owners). Surrounding buildings/owners incl. Lockheed (2 of 5 buildings), Astrotech (Lockheed parnership), Tyco Airport (Space Coast Regional), Goodgrain Distribution (look into this building as well)", "dateAdded": null},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "4025 & 4045 Dow Rd.", "status": "Price Discussions", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 2007.0, "units": 7.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": 0.09, "sqft": 33800.0, "acres": 2.35, "price": 2650000.0, "psf": 78.40236686390533, "notes": "(LBR) 2 multi-tenant buildings within 2 miles of new Ellis Rd. interchange under construction and just west of airport; city water & sewer; 3-phase power; poured concrete. Each unit has overhead door. $2.9MM ask. Pricing incl. adjacent outdoor fenced area. Rob checking to see if we can include 4005 Dow Rd. as well (single-tenant building w/35k SQFT at $100 PSF; LT tenant in place (will share financials if of interest). SUBMIT LOI once we receive the cross-parking and maintenance agreements. The additional building could bring the SQFT to 68,800 (add. 35k SQFT) and price to $6.15MM (add. $3.5MM).", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Digital Light Crossings Build-to-Suit", "status": "Prospect", "source": "LBR", "propertyType": "Development", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 150000.0, "acres": 14.24, "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(LBR) Build to suit development or ground lease option. Located just west of airport / south of Sarno Rd. Manufacturing, distribution, office, flex research and development. Tilt wall construction, 35' ceiling heights, dock-high loading, 3 phase electricity, sprinklers. LBR recommends that we acquire this land and mimic the Pineda property.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Ellis Road Industrial Complex", "status": "Targeting", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "TBC", "units": "TBC", "occupancy": "TBC", "capRate": "TBC", "sqft": 111000.0, "acres": "TBC", "price": "TBC", "psf": "TBC", "notes": "(Ullian) CIA building owned by tobacco attorney partnership (wealthy from huge tobacco settlement; not been motivated to sell). Larger tenants occupy this building. Mike will solicit pricing; there may be some interest in selling. Next Step: Await update later in 2020. Seller engaged an appraiser, but as of 12/11/19, group had not yet authorized a sale.", "dateAdded": "2019-10-30"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "4005 Opportunity Dr.", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 2004.0, "units": 1.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": "TBC", "sqft": 26100.0, "acres": 2.28, "price": 3495000.0, "psf": 133.90804597701148, "notes": "(Ullian) WAM found on Loopnet. Owned by a disaster recovery company. Owner wants to rent building to Harris or similar tenant and move his business into another building. Not priced to sell. Wait until pricing improves. Mike estimates land is worth ~$150-175k/acre in area and new tenant at $10-11.95 PSF NNN. May take up to 12 mo. to lease. VERY nice warehouse (clean w/AC & sprinklers) and office space. Higher grading / nice lot.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-06"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "2760 Business Center Blvd.", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": null, "units": 1.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": "TBC", "sqft": 31080.0, "acres": 5.51, "price": 3195000.0, "psf": 102.7992277992278, "notes": "(Ullian) Pricing incl. 3.75 acres of vacant land (priced ~$500k). Owner/user vacating property by year-end 2020 (Fred). Well located in northern Melbourne in industrial zone (near Wickham). Property will require signif. clean-up and improvements for new tenant, however attractive at right price and new tenant. Church across street from vacant land. New construction estimated at $105-$130 PSF for 20-30k SQFT (excl. land). Mike estimates could trade at $2.7-2.8MM to a user.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-30"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "2280, 2284, & 2288 Wilhelmina Court", "status": "", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Palm Bay", "yearBuilt": "1980's", "units": 3.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": 0.07, "sqft": 107264.0, "acres": 5.78, "price": 5810500.0, "psf": 54.17008502386635, "notes": "(Ullian) 3 buildings occupied by 6 national credit tenants w/3 or more years remaining. Owned by a group of absentee investors out of Miami (their only investment). Property desperately needs local management. Located in an old area, but new developments taking place.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-22"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Melbourne Business Park \n(4450 Enterprise Ct. / 751 Enterprise Ct.)", "status": "CIA Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 57000.0, "acres": 10.0, "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(CIA) 3 building multi-tenant flex facility located just south of Eau Gallie Blvd. A 9k SF unit listed was for $5 PSF NNN. 3-9k SQFT units available. ULLIAN TO CONFIRM INTEREST.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Dow Rodes Industrial Center \n(4280 Dow Rd.)", "status": "CIA Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1985.0, "units": 49.0, "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 14850.0, "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(CIA) 4 building multi-tenant office park zoned for light industrial uses. 49 units measuring 1,350 SF each. Rental rates start at $6 PSF NNN (OPEX is approx. $2.25/SF per year). Units can be combined; several advertised at 2,700 SF and 4,050 SF. ULLIAN TO CONFIRM INTEREST.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Perimeter Center\n(4450 Eau Gallie Blvd.)", "status": "CIA Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Office", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(Ullian) Multi-tenant single-story office business park; looks like a retail plaza. CIA property owned by Perimeter Center.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Vacant Land | Eau Gallie Blvd. / Sarno Rd.", "status": "Develop. Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex Development", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": 34.22, "price": 4995000.0, "psf": 145967.27060198714, "notes": "(Ullian) Vacant land owned by Bys Realty on Eau Gallie Rd. (next to Sarno turnoff); perfect for 2,500 SF bays / IEP Storage concept. 28 acres is zoned M-1 (light industrial) and 6.22 acres is zoned C-P (commercial parkway district, which is intended to serve the needs of motorists and provide an amenable impression of the city). Broker believes Seller would sell the industrial separately if desired. Utilities in place. Wawa will anchor the corner.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "6949 Old Nasa Blvd.", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": 1.0, "occupancy": 0.0, "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 15835.0, "acres": 2.5, "price": 1495000.0, "psf": 94.41111461951374, "notes": "(Ullian) Single-tenant flex warehouse just south of airport. Great frontage, but property is vacant. Owner-occupied. Extra land available for development. Maybe has redevelopment potential if tenant interest, however Mike believes the cost could push all above new development pricing. Wait for price reduction before pursue.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "Vicki Circle Warehouse\n(6951 Vicki Circle)", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Ullian", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1981.0, "units": 2.0, "occupancy": 0.5, "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 9370.0, "acres": 0.69, "price": 695000.0, "psf": 74.17289220917823, "notes": "(Ullian) Two-unit flex warehouse building; one unit is owner-occupied, while the other is vacant. Well located, but over-priced. Wait to see if seller motivation evolves.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-22"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "611 - 631 Washburn Rd.", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Loopnet", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Storage", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1984.0, "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": 0.075, "sqft": 28000.0, "acres": 2.01, "price": 2200000.0, "psf": 78.57142857142857, "notes": "(Loopnet) Multi-tenant warehouse/storage just west of airport and south of Eau Gallie / Sarno Rd. 28 12'x12' roll-up doors and 20' ceiling heights. Zoned for light industrial.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Under Review", "name": "West Drive Commercial Center\n(195 West Dr.)", "status": "Prospect", "source": "Loopnet", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "May have just recently sold since no longer on Loopnet (Todd Rosborough at Cornerstone Commercial Assoc.). Just north of Ellis Rd. Rents start at $7.20 PSF (3 year lease) and go up to $9 PSF (1 year lease). Units start at 1,000 SF and can be combined.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Prospects", "name": "The Edge at Eau Gallie Pointe \n(3905 W. Eau Gallie Blvd.)", "status": "", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 2019.0, "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 32337.0, "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(Loopnet) Developed and owned by Hardy World. Premium office/warehouse space offered at premium rental rates. Quality suitable for high-tech manufacturing / distribution.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Prospects", "name": "Big Boy Toy Storage", "status": "", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Storage", "location": "Rockledge, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(Ullian) Unique industrial storage property mentioned as a target or comp", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "Stan Drive Portfolio\n(315, 410, & 420 Stan Drive)", "status": "Revisit if Pricing Improves", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "1998 & \n2001", "units": 8.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": 0.07551347606028386, "sqft": 26750.0, "acres": 2.0, "price": 1733333.0, "psf": 64.79749532710281, "notes": "(Ullian) 3 buildings on 2 parcels of land on Stan Dr. off Ellis Rd.; 100% occupied w/8 tenants; gross leases. Light industrial. City water & septic. Metal building & roofs. 410 & 420 built in 2001 and 315 built in 1998. Owned by Bob Lee. Opportunity to raise rents to $8.50 PSF gross (from $7.16 PSF). Mike recommends keeping Adam (w/Ullian) as the leasing agent and property manager. LOI submitted at $1.55MM, but rejected. Seller wants $1.733MM (7.5% cap rate). Compare rents and cap rate against the appraiser's market data to validate. Declined 1/30/20 following property visit; near-term lease expirations may require significant TI / clean-up expense. Other deferred maintenance items would need to also be addressed, such as grading. Tenant exposure is relatively weak - local clusters (pottery studio, car repair, sign company) that are likely price sensitive. Modified gross leases vs. net.", "dateAdded": "2019-10-24"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "Wickham Business Park \n(2825 Business Center Blvd.)", "status": "Declined (condos / very high pricing)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "1999 - 2001", "units": 32.0, "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 45600.0, "acres": 5.62, "price": 3000000.0, "psf": 65.78947368421052, "notes": "(Ullian) 34 of 40 condo units sold to Bob Lee (Lee Commercial Holdings) in 2018. Now owns 32 units, or 42k SQFT. 54k SQFT for the entire 40 units; the other 8 units are owned by others (4 x 1,200 SF & 4 x 1,800 SF). Well-located property w/diverse tenant base; 1-3 yr leases. Adjacent units could become add-ons. Managed by Ullian, though he doesn't have a PM co. Bob would sell for $4.6MM (~5.9% cap rate / $110 PSF). Bob's strategy is to sell off individual units to users at $120-$130 PSF; to date, one sold at $117 PSF. Acreage shown is for total property.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "Pineda Business Center\n(5325 N. Wickham Rd.)", "status": "Not for Sale", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Office, Industrial, Storage", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 2019.0, "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "Office/Retail/Warehouse/Storage. Located along Wickham Rd. in Rockledge/North Melbourne area. Very well developed and designed for multi-use. Owned by William J. Page; not interested in selling. Owns free and clear w/no mortgage.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "Sarno Business Complex \n(2080-2260 Sarno Rd.)", "status": "Declined (retail-type product)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Office", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1962.0, "units": 32.0, "occupancy": 0.89, "capRate": 0.08, "sqft": 140040.0, "acres": 15.93, "price": 14029300.0, "psf": 100.1806626678092, "notes": "NDA execcuted. 16 acres of frontage on Sarno Rd.  Looks like an old strip mall or medical office converted to traditional office. Property has deferred maintenance. Location very strong, however too close to a retail product w/chinese restaurant, etc. Will require significant TI / modernization.", "dateAdded": "2019-11-19"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "2300 Commerce Park Dr.", "status": "Declined (condos)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Flex", "location": "Palm Bay", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": "n.a.", "price": "n.a.", "psf": "n.a.", "notes": "(Ullian) Multi-tenant office park to be aware of. Each unit is 9,800 SQFT and sold as condos. One was available for sale in January 2020. As an owner of one or a few units, we would be a minority investor. Controlled by a Maryland-based group who is also developing apartments and retail in the area.", "dateAdded": "2020-01-22"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Multi-Tenant", "name": "6958 Sonny Dale Drive", "status": "Declined (too small / high pricing)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Multi-Tenant Storage", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": 1985.0, "units": 5.0, "occupancy": 1.0, "capRate": 0.05464390243902439, "sqft": 6930.0, "acres": 0.99, "price": 410000.0, "psf": 59.16305916305916, "notes": "(Ullian) 5 units w/10 bay doors (10x10); fully leased w/ MTM leases. 14 parking spaces. Additional space could fit another 6,600 SQFT. Located just south of airport / NASA Blvd. Ullian believes can push rents to $8.50 PSF Gross and NOI to $50k. Seller has been occupying portion of property. Likely some clean-up and deferred maintenance. Too small, will require tenant turnaround, may need to address signif. deferred maintenance. Ullian will pursue personally.", "dateAdded": "2019-10-24"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Single-Tenant", "name": "2760 Business Center Blvd.", "status": "Declined (vacant / high pricing)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Single-Tenant Flex", "location": "Melbourne, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": 1.0, "occupancy": 0.0, "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": 31080.0, "acres": 5.51, "price": 3195000.0, "psf": 102.7992277992278, "notes": "(Ullian) Single-tenant flex warehouse marketed by Ullian in September 2019 at this offering price. Weak location in northern Melbourne. Vacant building with additional land for development. Owner currently occupying building. Best suited for contractor or manufacturer also needing outdoor storage. Would be expensive if we needed to sub-divide it.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Vacant Land", "name": "596 Haverty Court", "status": "Declined (vacant land)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Vacant Land", "location": "Rockledge, FL", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": 5.84, "price": 730000.0, "psf": 125000.0, "notes": "(Ullian) Vacant land in northern area; no frontage. Can support 65k SQFT. Site has low-quality wetlands that St. John's Management District has agreed can be leared if built under existing permit w/no changes. CIA will clear and fill the site and then add cost to sale price. Existing site plan could be changed after cleared and filled. Ullian believes site would be good for multi-tenant small bay development similar to Wickham Business Park. Confirm whether they own surrounding buildings; would make more attractive.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"},
  {"section": "Comparable — Vacant Land", "name": "5131 Babcock St. NE", "status": "Declined (vacant land)", "source": "", "propertyType": "Vacant Land", "location": "Palm Bay", "yearBuilt": "n.a.", "units": "n.a.", "occupancy": "n.a.", "capRate": "n.a.", "sqft": "n.a.", "acres": 1.48, "price": 444000.0, "psf": 300000.0, "notes": "(Ullian) Vacant land in southern area; weak location, though along Babcock Hwy. Owned by CIA.", "dateAdded": "2019-09-23"}
